        <mxCell id="fc_ts" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#6b7280" value="Four paths through one build, drawn the way the code runs them. Lane A is a session starting; lane B is the request lifecycle; lane C is what happens to &lt;i&gt;any&lt;/i&gt; write; lane D is a reading becoming a status. Lane C is the one worth reading first — every action in lanes B and D goes through it." vertex="1">
